{"type":"npc","name":"Volcanic Calamity Knight","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":290,"temp":0,"max":290,"details":""},"ac":{"value":37,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":20}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"fire","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":10,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"holy","value":10,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","necril","petran","pyric"],"details":""},"level":{"value":15},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Calamity knights are undead incarnations of various natural disasters. Some calamity knights see themselves as avatars of nature's vengeance. Others act as indiscriminate bringers of death and destruction. Whatever their motivations, calamity knights usually arise from individuals with deep ties to primal magic who die in the natural disaster that they will come to embody. The calamity knight detailed below has the power of a volcanic eruption. However, calamity knights can embody a broad range of other disasters, including earthquakes, famines, hurricanes, plagues, and tsunamis.</p><h2>Calamity Dragonrider</h2><p>Calamity knights sometimes form bonds with destructive dragons whose nature matches their own. For example, a calamity knight tied to volcanic eruptions might forge a connection with a crag linnorm or a volcanic primal dragon, with whom they collaborate to devastate an entire region. However, these alliances are often volatile, surviving only as long as both partners agree on their general objectives as well as the distribution of the spoils of their rampages. When a calamity knight and their draconic partner clash, the resulting battles leave scars on the landscape for generations to come.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 810/1,850/3,400 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (heavy), perception item, skill items (Athletics, Intimidation, Nature, Survival)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> burning barbs, constitution, death, earth, earth armor, energy resistant (fire, void), fire, fire shield, sensory (darkvision), spells (Primal: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.O7ZEqWjwdKyo2CUv]{Volcanic Eruption}), strength, throwing, unholy, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Trey Mclemore","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":8},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":8},"int":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":7},"cha":{"mod":6}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":28,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"tremorsense","acuity":"imprecise","range":60}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":29,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":23,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":26,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":30},"intimidation":{"base":30},"nature":{"base":27},"survival":{"base":27}},"traits":{"value":["earth","fire","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"6pFKNWj3Bfl9R50V","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/volcanic-calamity-knight.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Volcanic Calamity Knight","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/volcanic-calamity-knight.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":3,"scaleY":3,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":3,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/volcanic-calamity-knight.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"name":"Primal Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":28,"dc":36},"tradition":{"value":"primal"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"bLkRvY9tjsO8vFu2","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"xqlqJ6eeiNtWb7bq","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/volcanic-eruption.webp","name":"Volcanic Eruption","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Area</strong> 5-foot radius, 80-foot-tall cylinder</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The ground opens up, spraying a column of lava high into the air in a vertical cylinder, dealing 14d6 fire damage to creatures in the area. The lava rapidly cools and encases creatures in the area. A creature encased in rock is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} and takes a -10-foot status penalty to its Speeds. All normal terrain is difficult terrain to a flying creature, and such creatures immediately descend 20 feet the moment they're encased, but they don't take damage from this fall. A creature encased in rock can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} against your spell DC to end the effect. Otherwise, the creature remains encased until it takes a total of 50 damage, freeing it from the rock. Additionally, creatures in the area and those within 5 feet of the lava column automatically take @Damage[(@item.rank -4)d6[fire]] damage from the intense heat, regardless of the results of their saving throws.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.8UqFvOCZqecPam4Y]{Spell Effect: Volcanic Eruption}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is encased.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and is encased.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage in the area increases by 2d6, and the damage from the intense heat increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"volcanic-eruption","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","fire","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"type":"cylinder","value":5},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"14d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"fire"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"reflex"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"bLkRvY9tjsO8vFu2","heightenedLevel":8,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.O7ZEqWjwdKyo2CUv","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"cK3bKk1XC41Oyt0h"},{"type":"action","name":"Eruptive Shield","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The calamity knight carries a magma shield. In the knight's hands, the shield has Hardness 15, HP 120, and BT 60. The knight can spend 10 minutes to create a new Eruptive Shield; doing so destroys any existing shield.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"5Bh7ppLriSOzCD63","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"defau