},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"hlFWPSyQk3Oq09Dq","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Reactive Strike (Special)","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>The calamity knight can use Reactive Strike when a creature within their reach takes persistent fire damage, in addition to its normal trigger. If the triggering creature already had persistent fire damage, the calamity knight triggers a secondary eruption. The triggering creature and all creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:5] take @Damage[2d10[fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:36|basic]).</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":["fire","primal"],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"reactive-strike","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.W7SbTykXrNwxDzJc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"hWXUNwQNgfRPNBQH"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Shield Block (Special)","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>The calamity knight gains 1 extra reaction each round, which they can use only to Shield Block.</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ShieldBlock]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"shield-block","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.m4HQ2o5aPxjXf2kY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"A1pTsUCS9k0NXPQU"},{"type":"action","name":"Volcanic Defense","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The Calamity knight Raises a Shield. All creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:5] take @Damage[2d10[fire]|options:area-damage] damage and @Damage[2d10[persistent,fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:36|basic] save).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fire","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"c9ahiqLBmXZto3Vn","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Magma Blade","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["agile","fire","magical","reach-10"]},"damageRolls":{"LrFe9Gm6LAOAAnf5":{"damage":"2d8+10","damageType":"fire","category":null},"K