cons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Layering Lava","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>As the calamity knight continually piles magma on a target, it becomes harder to remove. Whenever the calamity knight would deal persistent fire damage to a creature that already has persistent fire damage, the DC of the flat check to remove the persistent fire damage increases by 1 (to a maximum DC of 20).</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.E4Bh0z7vZCAEdw8l]{Effect: Layering Lava}</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"uFSvId0DZYz4dJDJ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Magma Prison","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The calamity knight cools the magma on one of its foes into a rocky prison by transferring the heat into the foe's body. The knight chooses a creature within 60 feet who is taking persistent fire damage from one of their abilities. The creature takes @Damage[4d10[fire]] damage, becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, and takes a –10 status penalty to its Speeds until it [[/act escape dc=36]]{Escapes}. The persistent fire damage automatically ends.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.FxxY8qmts9hJA0nI]{Effect: Magma Prison}</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["earth","fire","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"7ycWo88g4BqCCGJE","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Pyroclastic Rush","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The calamity knight transforms into a pyroclastic flow. They travel up to 200 feet in a straight line, passing freely though creature's squares (though this movement can still trigger reactions). All creatures in their path take @Damage[7d6[fire],7d6[bludgeoning]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:38|basic]), and debris left behind makes the path difficult terrain. The calamity knight can't use Pyroclastic Rush for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["move"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"yPwWWiSbNb8GR5eY","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":10800000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{